SUMMARY:The Saturday Night Haunted Halloween Costume Bash! (2 Great Venues
 )
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 Get ready for a spooky and unforgettable **Halloween Saturday night filled
  with great music\, dancing\, DJ\, Live Band\, costumes\, laughter and opp
 ortunities to meet new people!**\n\n**Halloween** falls on a Saturday this
  year\, so we're making a full evening of it!\nWe'll begin at **Harp Pub a
 nd Café\,** right next door to Harp Tavern\, where we'll mingle with frie
 nds old and new\, admire everyone's costumes and dance the night away!\n\n
 Come on your own\, bring a friend or arrive with a group. Everyone is welc
 ome\, with plenty of opportunities to mingle\, dance and make new connecti
 ons.\n\n\\*Arrive early for dinner if you like- Please mention you are wit
 h Steve's group if you do\n\nJoined by my other groups too! :)\n\n***\n\nD
 etails below:\n\nSincerely\,\n\nDJ Steve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\n\n
 🎃 **Event Details:**\n\n**The Saturday Night Haunted Halloween Costume 
 Bash!**\n**Date: Saturday\, October 31\, 2026**\n**Time:** 8:30 PM\n**Loca
 tion: Harp Pub and Café\, next door to Harp Tavern**\n**174 Eglinton Aven
 ue East\, Toronto**\n(Please mention Steve with Meetup when you arrive.)\n
 Arrival Time: Please arrive between 8:30 pm and 10 pm (if you can)\n\n👻
  WHAT TO EXPECT:\n\n* A festive Halloween atmosphere with plenty of costum
 es and Halloween spirit\n* Great retro music and dancing with DJ Steve Fle
 mming\n* Mingling\, laughter\, conversation and new friendships\n* A welco
 ming atmosphere for singles\, couples and groups of friends\n* A chance to
  show off your Halloween costume\n* An optional late-night continuation at
  one or more other locations with Live Band and more Dancing! :)\n\nI'll b
 e your DJ from approximately 8:30 PM until 11:00 PM\, playing a great sele
 ction of retro 80s\, 90s and early 2000s music to keep the Halloween spiri
 t alive\; along with your requests :)\nAnd the night doesn't end there!\nJ
 ust after 11:00 PM\, we'll take a short four or five minute walk to Smoke 
 Show with a Live Band and more dancing!\n\n**Event Fee:** $10 per person (
 with costume) payable in cash at the door or by e-transfer in advance to S
 teveflemming11@gmail.com\n$15 dollars (without a costume)\n\nDress: Hallow
 een costumes encouraged! Be creative\, spooky\, funny\, glamorous or compl
 etely outrageous!\n\n***\n\n🎃 A FEW FRIENDLY REMINDERS:\n\n* Please kee
 p your RSVP updated if your plans change.\n* Everyone is responsible for t
 heir own food and beverages.\n* Please be friendly and respectful toward f
 ellow guests and venue staff.\n* Coming alone? Don't hesitate to introduce
  yourself. That's what our social gatherings are all about!\n\n***\n\nHall
 oween only comes once a year\, and this time it's on a Saturday night!\nSo
  find yourself a costume\, bring your Halloween spirit and join us for a n
 ight of music\, dancing\, friendship and fun!\n\nLooking forward to seeing
  everyone there!
