SUMMARY:The Saturday Night After Party with Live Band and Dancing! 
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 Get ready for a Saturday night of live music\, dancing\, rock n' roll and 
 top 40 party classics\; while having great times with friendly peers!\n\nW
 e’re heading to Smoke Show in Toronto for a night with Handsome Dewey & 
 the Swag\, GTA cover band that brings classic rock favourites and dance-fl
 oorhits to the stage.\n\nExpect the kind of music that gets people singing
  along\, moving onto the dance floor and remembering just how much fun a g
 reat Saturday night can be. Whether you come to dance\, enjoy the band\, m
 eet some new people\, or simply have a drink and hang out with friends\, y
 ou’re very welcome to join us.\n\n\\*Joined by my other groups too :)\n\
 nEvent details below:\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\n
 ────────────────────────\n
 EVENT DETAILS\n**The Saturday Night After Party with Live Band and Dancing
 !**\nHosted by Steve Flemming\n\nDate: Saturday\, November 7th\, 2026\nLoc
 ation: Smoke Show\nCity: Toronto\, Ontario\n\n🎸 LIVE MUSIC: Rude E Bone
 s\n🎶 Classic Rock • Rock Favourites • Dance-Floor Hits\n💃 Dancin
 g\n🍻 Drinks and Food Available\n🎉 Socializing and Good Times\n👋 N
 ew Members and Solo Attendees Welcome\nThis is a social night first and fo
 remost. Come meet some people\, enjoy the music\, have a drink\, hit the d
 ance floor—or do all four!\n──────────────
 ──────────\n**FRIENDLY REMINDERS**\n• Please be resp
 ectful and friendly toward everyone attending\n• If you RSVP\, please do
  your best to attend or update your RSVP if your plans change\n• Food an
 d beverages are purchased individually from the venue\n• Please drink re
 sponsibly and arrange safe transportation home\n• Look for Steve and the
  Meetup group when you arrive\n• Most importantly—come ready for some 
 great music and a fun Saturday night!\n\n**Event Fee**: $10 at the door (c
 ash only) or in advance by e-transfer to [steveflemming11@gmail.com](mailt
 o:steveflemming11@gmail.com)\nPlease mention that you are with Steve's gro
 up when you arrive.\nArrival Time: Please arrive between 8:30 PM and 10:00
  PM.\n\n**Parking:**\nParking on street and free parking found in resident
 ial area and on Mt. Pleasant north of Eglinton
