SUMMARY:Music Appreciation from the 1960s to 1980s Social Event! 
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nGood day everyone\,\
 n\nJoin us for a fun and interactive Sunday night celebrating the incredib
 le music of the 1960s\, 1970s and 1980s! We’ll listen to great songs\, s
 hare memories and opinions\, and talk about the artists and music that hel
 ped define three unforgettable decades.\nㅤ\nThis is more than just liste
 ning to music — everyone is encouraged to participate! Whether you grew 
 up with these songs or simply love discovering great music from the past\,
  come spend an enjoyable evening with friends and fellow music lovers.\n
 ㅤ\n\\*Joined by my other social groups too\; so we can anticipate a fabu
 lous turn out with lots of friendly peers to begin our weekend with!\n\n\\
 *Please note we are at **The Pheasant: A Firkin Pub** at 1999 Avenue Road 
 (roughly 6 blocks north of Lawrence - south of the 401 **(we will be in th
 e back dining area)**\n\n*\\*You can ask the bartender if you like to show
  you to the group (simply ask for Steve's event-easy to find)*\n\n-You'll 
 find it's a cozy\, relaxed and enjoyable atmosphere!\n\n**-Free Parking fo
 und on residential side streets**\n\n(Event Details Below)\n\nSincerely\,\
 n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\n\nEvent Details:\n**Music Appreciatio
 n from the 1960s to 1980s Social Event!**\n\n• Listen and learn about th
 e great music from the ’60s\, ’70s and ’80s\n• Share your favourit
 e songs\, singers\, albums and bands\n• Take part in fun\, interactive m
 usic discussions\n• Hear some forgotten gems and rediscover old favourit
 es\n• Meet other people who enjoy music and good conversation\nㅤ\nCome
  listen\, reminisce\, laugh and enjoy a Sunday night of great music and gr
 eat company!\n\n**Steve Flemming** has been a DJ since the early 2000s wit
 h a lifelong passion for music\, especially from the 1960s\, ’70s and 
 ’80s. Raised by a father who was also a DJ during the ’70s and ’80s\
 , music has always been a big part of Steve’s life. He enjoys sharing gr
 eat songs and bringing people together through music.\n\n**Event Fee:** 5 
 dollars (Cash only at the door) (HST included)\nor by e transfer: stevefle
 mming11@gmail.com\n\\*No extra charge for those attending the earlier even
 t\n\n**Friendly Reminders:**\n\n-Arrive any time between 5:30 pm and 7:00 
 pm (if you can)\n-arrive earlier if you like) (please ask for Steve when y
 ou arrive\n\n\\*Great dinner menu and food specials provided:\n(One bevera
 ge or appetizer minimum upon arrival to support venue)\n\n**Parking and Tr
 ansportation:**\n\\*Lots of street parking on avenue and free residential 
 parking\nhttps://www.firkinpubs.com/thepheasantandfirkin/\n\n(15-20 minute
  walk from Yonge & Lawrence subway station-or simply take bus or uber from
  the station)
